{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51502","headline":"平望驿感先辈李从实处士周鉷二故人 · 李郢","name":"平望驿感先辈李从实处士周鉷二故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芦苇风多驿堠长，昔年携手上河梁。\n青云才子鸳鸿季，白石山人芝木香。\n华骥欲陪先道路，大川斯济戢舟航，少微星没桂枝重，正挂孤帆过水乡（《百城烟水》四《吴江》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}